<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref} from 'vue'
import {useCareerStore} from '../stores/career'
const store=useCareerStore(),answer=ref(''),message=ref('')
async function start(){message.value='';try{await store.startInterview()}catch(e:any){message.value=e.message}}
async function submit(){if(!answer.value.trim())return;await store.submitAnswer(answer.value);answer.value=''}
</script>
<template><section class="workspace-page interview-page"><div v-if="!store.interview" class="interview-intro"><span>◉</span><p class="kicker">TARGETED INTERVIEW</p><h2>不是随机题库，<br>而是针对你的证据缺口。</h2><p>从目标岗位的必需技能出题，结构化评估知识覆盖；回答不足时只进行一次有目的的追问。</p><ul><li>岗位差距驱动</li><li>一次针对性追问</li><li>分技能面试报告</li></ul><p v-if="message" class="form-error">{{message}}</p><button class="button light" @click="start">开始模拟面试 ↗</button></div><div v-else-if="store.question" class="surface interview-question"><div class="question-index"><span>QUESTION {{String(store.question.sequenceNo).padStart(2,'0')}}</span><b>{{store.question.skillName}} · {{store.question.difficulty}}</b></div><h2>{{store.question.question}}</h2><div class="answer-guide"><span>建议结构</span><p>结论 → 原理 → 项目场景 → 行动 → 可验证结果</p></div><textarea v-model="answer" rows="10" placeholder="输入你的回答…"></textarea><div class="form-actions"><button class="plain-button" @click="store.finishInterview">提前结束</button><button class="button" :disabled="store.loading||!answer.trim()" @click="submit">提交回答</button></div></div><div v-else-if="store.report" class="surface interview-report"><p class="kicker">INTERVIEW REPORT</p><div class="report-score"><b>{{store.report.totalScore}}</b><span>综合得分</span></div><div class="report-grid"><article><span>优势技能</span><p>{{store.report.report.strengths.join('、')||'继续积累可验证证据'}}</p></article><article><span>薄弱技能</span><p>{{store.report.report.weaknesses.join('、')||'暂无明显薄弱项'}}</p></article></div><h3>下一步建议</h3><ol><li v-for="suggestion in store.report.report.suggestions" :key="suggestion">{{suggestion}}</li></ol><button class="outline-button" @click="store.interview=undefined;store.report=undefined">重新开始</button></div></section></template>
